        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: संस्कार",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संस्कार — saṁskār — \"upbringing, values instilled\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर बच्चों को अच्छे संस्कार मिलेंगे तो वे अच्छे इंसान बनेंगे। agar baccoṁ ko acche saṁskār mileṅge to ve acche insān baneṅge. If children are brought up well, they will become good people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संस्कार (saṁskār) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit saṃskāra, \"refining; an impression\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
